# Data files


## seriestasjoner.csv

Discharge stations with the modelled discharge area, lowflow and highflow discharge values. Taken from results by NVEs NEVINA solution.

The NIFS highflow values should be chosen according to this specification:

Areal: 0,2 – 53 km2
Normalavrenning: 9 – 163 l/s·km2
Effektiv sjøprosent: 0 – 21 %


## seriedata.csv

Discharge measurements at NVE station. Fetched from NVEs Hydapi with daily interval.

